autocomplete="current-password"><button class="password-toggle" id="togglePassword" type="button" aria-label="Show password">Show</button></div><div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:8px"><a href="forgot_password.php" style="font-size:.78rem;font-weight:800">Forgot password?</a></div></div><button class="auth-submit" type="submit">Sign In Securely</button></form><div class="customer-choice"><h3>Customer access</h3><p>Choose the path that matches your relationship with the club.</p><div class="choice-grid"><a class="choice-card" href="#email"><b>Not a Club Member</b><span>Use the normal Customer login above. Your portal will show Club membership and current offer invitations.</span></a><a class="choice-card member" href="club_member_login.php"><b>Already a Club Member?</b><span>Open Club Member Login and verify your assigned Club Member ID with your normal password.</span></a></div></div><div class="auth-security"><strong>Protected by advanced security:</strong> password/session controls, Administrator account locks, suspicious-login alerts, trusted-device recognition and optional authenticator two-step verification. Trusted devices never bypass the password or an enabled authenticator challenge.</div></section></div></main><script>document.getElementById('togglePassword')?.addEventListener('click',function(){const p=document.getElementById('password');const show=p.type==='password';p.type=show?'text':'password';this.textContent=show?'Hide':'Show';this.setAttribute('aria-label',show?'Hide password':'Show password')});</script></body></html>
